<title>UK: SOCGEN SAYS PLACES ABB'S ELEKTRIM STAKE.</title>
<headline>SOCGEN SAYS PLACES ABB'S ELEKTRIM STAKE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale European Emerging Markets said on Monday it had placed ABB Asea Brown Boveri AG's (ABB) 8.8 percent stake in Polish industrial and trading conglomerate Elektrim SA with 11 institutional investors.</p>
<p>A SocGen spokesman told Reuters it had placed the stake of 5.92 million shares at 25.8 zlotys each. The transaction value was 152.7 million zlotys (48.6 million).</p>
<p>He said that the stake had been placed with 11 institutions in the U.S., UK and Europe.</p>
<p>-- Andrew Gill, London newsroom +171 542 5887 ( = 3.143 Polish Zlotys)</p>
